Third-party content bundled with this project
---------------------------------------------

app/src/main/assets/adblock_hosts.txt is generated by tools/build_blocklist.py
and merges domain lists that are not covered by the MIT licence above:

  * AdAway default blocklist
      Copyright (c) AdAway and contributors
      Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported licence
      https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
      https://github.com/AdAway/adaway.github.io

  * Peter Lowe's ad/tracker server list
      https://pgl.yoyo.org/adservers/
      The author states the list may be combined with other lists and
      redistributed.

That file is a modified version: its sources are merged, filtered to the
formats this app understands, and combined with a curated project-owned set.
The attribution required by CC BY 3.0 is reproduced in the header of the
generated file itself.

No third-party source code is bundled; every line of Java, JavaScript and CSS
in this repository was written for this project.